{"Title":"An Act relative to license transparency","BillNumber":"H3354","DocketNumber":"HD2548","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BHJ1","Name":"Bradley H. Jones, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BHJ1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T15:35:59.19"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BHJ1","Name":"Bradley H. Jones, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BHJ1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T15:35:59.19"},{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T18:35:09.8866667"},{"Id":"NAG1","Name":"Nicholas A. Boldyga","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NAG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T10:18:23.85"},{"Id":"KNF1","Name":"Kimberly N. Ferguson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KNF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T13:14:22.4166667"},{"Id":"SWG1","Name":"Susan Williams Gifford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SWG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T16:01:06.27"},{"Id":"L_M1","Name":"Lenny Mirra","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T16:56:24.4"},{"Id":"KWP1","Name":"Kelly W. Pease","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KWP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T09:38:39.07"},{"Id":"AMS2","Name":"Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMS2","ResponseDate":"2023-02-09T17:53:29.8866667"},{"Id":"MSV1","Name":"Marcus S. Vaughn","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSV1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T11:26:07.5766667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3354/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Jones of North Reading, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3354) of Bradley H. Jones, Jr., and others relative to motor vehicle license transparency.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Subsection (b) of section 7 of chapter 81 of the Acts of 2022 is hereby amended by inserting after the words “regulations promulgated by the attorney general;”, in the second to last sentence the following words: \r\n\tsaid regulations shall, at a minimum, require the registrar of motor vehicles to provide information on the holder of a Massachusetts license (1) to any city or town clerk seeking to verify the identity and eligibility of any individual using a Massachusetts license to vote or to register to vote and (2) in response to a request from any state law enforcement agency pursuant to an investigation.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}